 <p>Un <b>graphique</b> adapté peut donner une réponse approximative.</p>\n  </div>\n </div></div>         </li>\t      <li>\t       <span class=\"oef-mark-choice\" name=\"reply1\" data-pos=\"7\">algorithme</span>                            <div class=\"inline\"><span class=\"bubble_speaker left-in\"></span><style>\n#bubble_229{background-color: lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.thought:before, #bubble_229.thought:after{background-color: lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle:not(.btm-left):after{border-top-color:   lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.left-in:after{       border-right-color: lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.btm-left:after{      border-left-color:  lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.btm-left-in:after{   border-left-color:  lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.btm-right-in:after{  border-right-color: lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.btm-right:after{     border-right-color: lightgreen;}\n#bubble_229.triangle.right-in:after{      border-left-color:  lightgreen;}\n</style>\n<div id=\"bubble_229\" class=\"talk-bubble inline left-in  round triangle shadow\" style=\"width:250px;height:100px;\">\n  <div class=\"talktext\">\n    <p>J'imagine un <b>algorithme</b> pour estimer ce nombre avec une bonne précision.</p>\n  </div>\n </div></div>     </li>\t    </ul>\t\t     <div class=\"oef-enterreply\">Entrez votre réponse :</div><br><label for=\"reply1\">Méthode</label> : <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"14\"></span>",
